Then, we need to determine the cost of the shoes. Mishka purchased 3 pairs of shoes, and each pair costs $42. Multiplying 3 by 42 will give us the total cost for the shoes.

Finally, we'll add up the total costs for the shorts, pants, and shoes to find the overall amount Mishka spent on all the clothing items.

